1..4
# Subtest: Subset of a coercion
    1..7
    ok 1 - variable of subset type has the right type
    ok 2 - the variable got the right value
    ok 3 - function parameter of subset type has the right type
    ok 4 - the parameter got the right value
    ok 5 - constraint type matches against coercive subset
    ok 6 - target type matches against coercive subset
    ok 7 - a string is coerced and matches against subset
ok 1 - Subset of a coercion
# Subtest: Subset of a definite
    1..3
    ok 1 - the subset compiles
    # Subtest: doesn't accept undefineds
        1..2
